200
00:19:07,880 --> 00:19:08,880
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Really?</b></font>

201
00:19:09,670 --> 00:19:13,630
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Huh? Aren't you good friends
