202
00:19:14,540 --> 00:19:15,540
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Not really…</b></font>

203
00:19:16,040 --> 00:19:17,880
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Oh?</b></font>

204
00:19:23,290 --> 00:19:24,290
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke…</b></font>

205
00:19:26,080 --> 00:19:28,790
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I really like…</b></font>

206
00:19:29,330 --> 00:19:30,420
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What is it?</b></font>

207
00:19:32,790 --> 00:19:34,420
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Who are you?</b></font>

208
00:19:45,380 --> 00:19:47,750
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What's up with that girl?</b></font>

209
00:19:49,080 --> 00:19:53,000
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You're not supposed to
