00:20:41,170 --> 00:20:44,170
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>She's amazing!</b></font>

213
00:22:42,130 --> 00:22:44,750
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I see, that's right!

</b></font>

214
00:22:45,170 --> 00:22:47,710
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>When I look up at the sky, 

</b></font>

